<title>USA: Levitz April same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Levitz April same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Levitz Furniture Inc said Tuesday same-store sales increased 0.6 percent in April compared with the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company said total sales for the month were $69.0 million compared with $69.3 million for the same period last year, a decrease of 0.4 percent.</p>
</text>
